      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indian_Beach%2C_North_Carolina",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town is split into two sections, divided by the unincorporated neighborhood of Salter Path.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
